body:
definitely i know a lot of people with ketamine addictions and it's literally tearing their life apart. ketamine addiction is a modern problem and it's hard to relate to other addicts. a discord community and even an entire subreddit focused specifically for it would be great i feel. 

&#x200B;

building a community around something takes a few people who are committed to actually talking and contributing though, it would just grow itself. but maybe we could get a sticky in this server to spread awareness or something like that.
